ot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Driven by hatred and a thirst for revenge, he climbed to the position of a 9th-circle archmage, but in the end, all that remained was emptiness.\u00a0&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Realizing his mistakes too late, Ferda returned to the starting point of it all.\u00a0&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The day he was informed of her engagement to the &amp;quot;King of Beasts,&amp;quot; a sentence no different from a death warrant for nobles.\u00a0&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;Get engaged to Queen Valdrova.&amp;quot;\u00a0&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;Alright, I will.&amp;quot;\u00a0&amp;quot;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;...What?&amp;quot;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This time, he decided to do it. The engagement with the red dragon that he had killed with his own hands.&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;alt_title&quot;:&quot;\ub0b4\uac00 \uc8fd\uc778 \ub4dc\ub798\uace4\uacfc \uacb0\ud63c\ud588\ub2e4&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;web_novel&quot;,&quot;state&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;story_state&quot;:&quot;completed&quot;,&quot;release_year&quot;:null,&quot;origin_id&quot;:2,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;global_note&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;global_note_position&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;default_price&quot;:0,&quot;cover_id&quot;:9754,&quot;banner_id&quot;:9755,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-09 18:39:16&quot;,&quot;premium_index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14 18:55:26&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2024-12-20T19:30:50.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-09T15:39:16.000000Z&quot;,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;user&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3614,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Selene&quot;},&quot;cover&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:9754,&quot;disk&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;directory&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;281f029d-aabc-4b1b