-14T15:55:26.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:403,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null},{&quot;id&quot;:611053,&quot;series_id&quot;:90045,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;404&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Dawn&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chapter 404: Dawn&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:404,&quot;price&quot;:25,&quot;unlocked_at&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:53:51.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:53:51.000000Z&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:53:51.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:402,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null},{&quot;id&quot;:611052,&quot;series_id&quot;:90045,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;403&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Last Week&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chapter 403: The Last Week&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:403,&quot;price&quot;:25,&quot;unlocked_at&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:53:11.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:53:11.000000Z&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:53:11.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:401,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null},{&quot;id&quot;:611049,&quot;series_id&quot;:90045,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;402&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Form of Each Other&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chapter 402: The Form of Each Other&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:402,&quot;price&quot;:25,&quot;unlocked_at&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:52:06.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:52:06.000000Z&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:52:06.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:400,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null},{&quot;id&quot;:611048,&quot;series_id&quot;:90045,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;401&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;What Is Precious&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chapter 401: What Is Precious&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:401,&quot;price&quot;:25,&quot;unlocked_at&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:50:51.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:50:51.000000Z&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:50:51.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:399,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null},{&quot;id&quot;:611032,&quot;series_id&quot;:90045,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;400&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;One Wish&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chapter 400: One Wish&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:400,&quot;price&quot;:20,&quot;unlocked_at&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:33:12.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:33:12.000000Z&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:33:12.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:398,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null},{&quot;id&quot;:611031,&quot;series_id&quot;:90045,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;399&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;An Inevitable Parting&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chapter 399: An Inevitable Parting&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:399,&quot;price&quot;:20,&quot;unlocked_at&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:32:30.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:32:30.000000Z&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:32:30.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:397,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null},{&quot;id&quot;:611030,&quot;series_id&quot;:90045,&quot;user_id&quot;:3614,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;398&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;A Long and Short Life&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chapter 398: A Long and Short Life&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:398,&quot;price&quot;:20,&quot;unlocked_at&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:32:05.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:32:05.000000Z&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-14T15:32:05.000000Z&quot;,&quot;group_id&quot;:null,&quot;index&quot;:396,&quot;is_premium&quot;:true,&quot;group&quot;:null}]},&quot;totalChapters&quot;:402,&quot;recommended&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:167348,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Incredibly, I Became the Villainess&#039;s Brother&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;incredibly-i-became-the-villainesss-brother&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Plot Summary&lt;\/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I woke up inside the body of &amp;#039;Enoch&amp;#039;, the older brother of the villainess &amp;#039;Saila&amp;#039; from the romance fantasy novel &lt;em&gt;The Tyrant&amp;#039;s Hidden Blade&lt;\/em&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It was a sudden possession, but his mission was clear:&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stop his younger sister Saila from liking the male lead, so she doesn&amp;#039;t end up getting killed by him!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;However...&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Saila, just in case you happen to like His Highness the Crown Prince\u2014&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;No way! How could I ever like someone as stupid as him?&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What on earth is going on here?&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the original story, Saila went crazy with jealousy, but now she doesn&amp;#039;t care about the male lead at all.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Still, it is too early to relax.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Saila is only 8 years old, and there is no telling how the future might change.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just keeping an eye on the Crown Prince is already keeping him busy, but somehow the First Princess finds out and threatens him by bringing up his &amp;quot;possession.&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On top of that, the Emperor&amp;#039;s half-brother, Grand Duke Adelvio Cezaser, who rules the western part of the empire, keeps showing suspicious interest in Enoch...&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Is my word a joke to you?&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;No.&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Then why are you acting like that? Can&amp;#039;t you act in a way that pleases me? Or are you doing this on purpose? Do you want me to come find you myself? Is that it?&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At first, I just thought he was a crazy bastard.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;I&amp;#039;m interested in you.&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;...In me? Why?&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Do I need a reason to be interested? My eyes are drawn to you, and my heart follows, so that&amp;#039;s why.&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second time, I still thought he was a crazy bastard. But...&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Call my name first.&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;...O\u2014&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Hmm? I can&amp;#039;t hear you well.&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;...Adel, Adelvio!&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;...Well done, Enoch.&amp;quot;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Why on earth do I keep developing strange feelings for this crazy bastard?&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;alt_title&quot;:&quot;\ubbff\uc744 \uc218 \uc5c6\uac8c\ub3c4 \uc545\ub140\uc758 \uc624\ube60\uac00 \ub418\uc5c8\ub2e4&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;web_novel&quot;,&quot;state&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;story_state&quot;:&quot;ongoing&quot;,&quot;release_year&quot;:&quot;2026&quot;,&quot;origin_id&quot;:2,&quot;user_id&quot;:25785,&quot;global_note&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;YOU CAN PING ME ON DISCORD &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;global_note_position&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;default_price&quot;:0,&quot;cover_id&quot;:11665,&quot;banner_id&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:31:22&quot;,&quot;premium_index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-11 13:29:43&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-09-25T09:36:48.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:31:22.000000Z&quot;,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;cover&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:11665,&quot;disk&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;directory&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ff616af3-6a0f-46fb-bb11-211c38964cd4&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;media\/ff616af3-6a0f-46fb-bb11-211c38964cd4.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:864,&quot;height&quot;:1236,&quot;size&quot;:736502,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;ext&quot;:&quot;jpg&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Gemini_Generated_Image_ie2t81ie2t81ie2t&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;caption&quot;:null,&quot;exif&quot;:{&quot;FILE&quot;:{&quot;FileName&quot;:&quot;vm9GSapXxqcYHm7ia4z0Hfo19MRDQ5FiIPEvDF5n.jpg&quot;,&quot;FileDateTime&quot;:1790328839,&quot;FileSize&quot;:736502,&quot;FileType&quot;:2,&quot;MimeType&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;SectionsFound&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;COMPUTED&quot;:{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;width=\&quot;864\&quot; height=\&quot;1236\&quot;&quot;,&quot;Height&quot;:1236,&quot;Width&quot;:864,&quot;IsColor&quot;:1}},&quot;curations&quot;:null,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-09-25T09:34:01.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-09-25T09:34:01.000000Z&quot;,&quot;tenant_id&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ff616af3-6a0f-46fb-bb11-211c38964cd4.jpg&quot;,&quot;full_path&quot;:&quot;\/www\/wwwroot\/brightnovels.com\/storage\/app\/public\/media\/ff616af3-6a0f-46fb-bb11-211c38964cd4.jpg&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ff616af3-6a0f-46fb-bb11-211c38964cd4.jpg&quot;,&quot;medium_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ff616af3-6a0f-46fb-bb11-211c38964cd4.jpg&quot;,&quot;large_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ff616af3-6a0f-46fb-bb11-211c38964cd4.jpg&quot;,&quot;pretty_name&quot;:&quot;Gemini_Generated_Image_ie2t81ie2t81ie2t&quot;}},{&quot;id&quot;:163892,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;I inherited the basement of the tower.&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;i-inherited-the-basement-of-the-tower&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synopsis&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Penalty? What\u2019s the big deal?&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kang Hajin, the first in the world to awaken as an SSS-class, had expected only a bright, rosy future.&lt;br&gt;\u00a0But an unexpected trial suddenly befalls him:&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Exposed to sunlight.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The hidden penalty of the Night Knight is revealed.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excessive sunlight exposure reduces all stats by 90%.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u201cWhat? With a penalty like that, how am I supposed to conquer the tower? Get lost.\u201d&lt;br&gt;\u00a0&lt;br&gt;Yet, at the brink of despair, a miracle appears:&lt;br&gt;\u00a0&lt;br&gt;\u3010You have obtained the Key to the Tower\u2019s Basement (Legendary).\u3011&lt;br&gt;\u00a0\u3010Congratulations. You have awakened as the tower\u2019s first \u2018Basement Player\u2019.\u3011&lt;br&gt;\u00a0\u3010Daylight never reaches the tower\u2019s basement.\u3011&lt;br&gt;\u00a0\u3010Trait \u2018Night Knight (SSS)\u2019 evolves into \u2018Knight of Eternal Night (EX)\u2019.\u3011&lt;br&gt;\u00a0&lt;br&gt;\u201cWait\u2026 is this guy a one-shot too?\u201d&lt;br&gt;\u00a0&lt;br&gt;No longer powerless against the sun,&lt;br&gt;\u00a0the world\u2019s first EX-class hunter, Kang Hajin, begins his unstoppable conquest of the tower\u2019s underground!&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;alt_title&quot;:&quot;\ud0d1\uc758 \uc9c0\ud558 1\uce35\uc744 \uc0c1\uc18d\ubc1b\uc558\ub2e4&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;web_novel&quot;,&quot;state&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;story_state&quot;:&quot;ongoing&quot;,&quot;release_year&quot;:&quot;2026&quot;,&quot;origin_id&quot;:2,&quot;user_id&quot;:22736,&quot;global_note&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;global_note_position&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;default_price&quot;:0,&quot;cover_id&quot;:12307,&quot;banner_id&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:30:40&quot;,&quot;premium_index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-12 14:07:13&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-02-25T04:55:04.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:30:40.000000Z&quot;,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;cover&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:12307,&quot;disk&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;directory&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;f9257715-f42f-4541-a394-03b97ddec048&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;media\/f9257715-f42f-4541-a394-03b97ddec048.png&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;height&quot;:1536,&quot;size&quot;:3037803,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;ext&quot;:&quot;png&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;jdiquq9ue&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;caption&quot;:null,&quot;exif&quot;:null,&quot;curations&quot;:null,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-10T15:51:32.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-10T15:51:32.000000Z&quot;,&quot;tenant_id&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/f9257715-f42f-4541-a394-03b97ddec048.png&quot;,&quot;full_path&quot;:&quot;\/www\/wwwroot\/brightnovels.com\/storage\/app\/public\/media\/f9257715-f42f-4541-a394-03b97ddec048.png&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/f9257715-f42f-4541-a394-03b97ddec048.png&quot;,&quot;medium_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/f9257715-f42f-4541-a394-03b97ddec048.png&quot;,&quot;large_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/f9257715-f42f-4541-a394-03b97ddec048.png&quot;,&quot;pretty_name&quot;:&quot;jdiquq9ue&quot;}},{&quot;id&quot;:161178,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;I&#039;ve already failed once&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;ive-already-failed-once&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An unlucky man, An Si-hoo, lost his parents in an accident and awakened as a Hunter\u2014only to later watch his only sister murdered by a villain.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Known among Hunters as &lt;strong&gt;Salgwi (\u6bba\u9b3c, Ghost Slayer)&lt;\/strong&gt;, he eventually challenged the final dungeon of the world quest, where the fate of Earth itself hung in the balance. After a desperate struggle, he struck down the boss\u2014only to realize it was all a mistake.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\u201cGive up.\u201d&lt;br&gt;\u00a0\u201cCough\u2026!\u201d&lt;br&gt;\u00a0\u201cYou ruined everything.\u201d&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before his eyes, his last remaining friend died. A blade pierced his heart. His nightmarish life ended in despair.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;[Planet Earth in Star System A-341 has been destroyed.]&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;That was supposed to be the end of the world.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yet when he opened his eyes, he found himself back in his own room\u2014alive. His family was alive as well.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And then came a voice:&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;\u2014I give you: an unbreakable, immortal will, and the strength to see it through!&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reborn, An Si-hoo awakens the mythical martial art once hailed as the strongest of the Northern Continent: the &lt;strong&gt;Northern Hegemonic Knight God&lt;\/strong&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, with a second chance at life, he must unravel the mystery of the traitor who stabbed him in the back, uncover the truth buried in the past, and succeed in clearing the world quest to prevent Earth\u2019s destruction.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From a broken Salgwi, he rises again\u2014this time as humanity\u2019s strongest martial artist.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The unyielding throne of power.&lt;br&gt;\u00a0The unstoppable defender of Earth.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;I believe. You are the main character in this fight. You are\u2026 our hope.&amp;quot;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;alt_title&quot;:&quot;\uc774\ubbf8 \ud55c \ubc88 \ub9dd\ud558\uace0 \uc654\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;web_novel&quot;,&quot;state&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;story_state&quot;:&quot;ongoing&quot;,&quot;release_year&quot;:&quot;2024&quot;,&quot;origin_id&quot;:2,&quot;user_id&quot;:22762,&quot;global_note&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;global_note_position&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;default_price&quot;:0,&quot;cover_id&quot;:9326,&quot;banner_id&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:30:17&quot;,&quot;premium_index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:30:17&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-09-17T20:04:27.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:30:17.000000Z&quot;,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;cover&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:9326,&quot;disk&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;directory&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;82c6ca00-2da8-478e-a005-772232c51573&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;media\/82c6ca00-2da8-478e-a005-772232c51573.png&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1054,&quot;height&quot;:1493,&quot;size&quot;:2485222,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;ext&quot;:&quot;png&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;56f8bae4-6a7e-4670-8390-0fe991fd8965&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;caption&quot;:null,&quot;exif&quot;:null,&quot;curations&quot;:null,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-07-05T21:26:25.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-07-05T21:26:25.000000Z&quot;,&quot;tenant_id&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/82c6ca00-2da8-478e-a005-772232c51573.png&quot;,&quot;full_path&quot;:&quot;\/www\/wwwroot\/brightnovels.com\/storage\/app\/public\/media\/82c6ca00-2da8-478e-a005-772232c51573.png&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/82c6ca00-2da8-478e-a005-772232c51573.png&quot;,&quot;medium_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/82c6ca00-2da8-478e-a005-772232c51573.png&quot;,&quot;large_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/82c6ca00-2da8-478e-a005-772232c51573.png&quot;,&quot;pretty_name&quot;:&quot;56f8bae4-6a7e-4670-8390-0fe991fd8965&quot;}},{&quot;id&quot;:167445,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Transmigrated as the Beloved Protagonist\u2019s Cannon-Fodder Childhood Sweetheart&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;transmigrated-as-the-beloved-protagonists-cannon-fodder-childhood-sweetheart&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Xie Sui was born with everything the world could offer\u2014an illustrious family background, an extraordinary appearance, and an untouchable, elegant temperament.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, he also possessed something far more dangerous: the attention of three powerful men who became hopelessly obsessed with him.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the original novel, Xie Sui was destined to become their captive. The gentle senior, the domineering CEO, and the arrogant rival joined forces to destroy the Xie family, imprison Xie Sui, and crush his pride until he had no choice but to depend on them.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But before that fate could unfold, Song Yu\u2014a reader who hated the novel&amp;#039;s twisted plot\u2014somehow transmigrated into it.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And not just as anyone.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He became the third young master of the Song family, an insignificant side character who was destined to die young from a terminal illness\u2026 and Xie Sui&amp;#039;s childhood sweetheart.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Song Yu: &lt;strong&gt;Absolutely not.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the original plot wanted to turn his little childhood sweetheart into a broken and helpless captive, then he would simply rewrite the ending himself.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He would protect Xie Sui, keep those three lunatics far away from him, and make sure his childhood sweetheart lived a happy life.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What Song Yu didn&amp;#039;t know was that Xie Sui had also been reborn.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In his previous life, Xie Sui had crawled out of an abyss of blood and darkness, destroying the three families and personally killing every enemy who had tormented him.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When he opened his eyes again, he was fifteen years old.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This time, he decided to bury the darkness within him and become the gentle, refined young master everyone remembered.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everything seemed destined to follow the same path as before.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Until Song Yu appeared.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The childhood sweetheart he had almost forgotten\u2014the blurry figure buried somewhere in the depths of his memories\u2014had suddenly returned to his life.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And this time, Song Yu reached out his hand first.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Like a spring breeze melting frozen earth, that warm hand slowly pulled Xie Sui out of the abyss.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But as Song Yu desperately tries to protect his precious childhood sweetheart from the three future villains, he fails to notice one small problem\u2026&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The person he is trying so hard to protect may be the most dangerous one of them all.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;alt_title&quot;:&quot;\u7a7f\u6210\u842c\u4eba\u8ff7\u7684\u70ae\u7070\u7af9\u99ac&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;web_novel&quot;,&quot;state&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;story_state&quot;:&quot;ongoing&quot;,&quot;release_year&quot;:&quot;2020&quot;,&quot;origin_id&quot;:3,&quot;user_id&quot;:31858,&quot;global_note&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;global_note_position&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;default_price&quot;:0,&quot;cover_id&quot;:11791,&quot;banner_id&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:29:11&quot;,&quot;premium_index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:29:11&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-09-29T03:30:15.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:29:11.000000Z&quot;,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;cover&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:11791,&quot;disk&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;directory&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ce00e94a-1873-403b-8f1e-f1a04eae3310&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;media\/ce00e94a-1873-403b-8f1e-f1a04eae3310.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;height&quot;:800,&quot;size&quot;:57737,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;ext&quot;:&quot;jpg&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;bc965abf756e826aafaa90ad90bd505f&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;caption&quot;:null,&quot;exif&quot;:{&quot;FILE&quot;:{&quot;FileName&quot;:&quot;WsCSAkdwQyakanjyRQNJqIxHwkDwJa5pum3P4I6d.jpg&quot;,&quot;FileDateTime&quot;:1790652569,&quot;FileSize&quot;:57737,&quot;FileType&quot;:2,&quot;MimeType&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;SectionsFound&quot;:&quot;COMMENT&quot;},&quot;COMPUTED&quot;:{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;width=\&quot;600\&quot; height=\&quot;800\&quot;&quot;,&quot;Height&quot;:800,&quot;Width&quot;:600,&quot;IsColor&quot;:1},&quot;COMMENT&quot;:[&quot;CREATOR: gd-jpeg v1.0 (using IJG JPEG v62), default quality\n&quot;]},&quot;curations&quot;:null,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-09-29T03:30:11.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-09-29T03:30:11.000000Z&quot;,&quot;tenant_id&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ce00e94a-1873-403b-8f1e-f1a04eae3310.jpg&quot;,&quot;full_path&quot;:&quot;\/www\/wwwroot\/brightnovels.com\/storage\/app\/public\/media\/ce00e94a-1873-403b-8f1e-f1a04eae3310.jpg&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ce00e94a-1873-403b-8f1e-f1a04eae3310.jpg&quot;,&quot;medium_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ce00e94a-1873-403b-8f1e-f1a04eae3310.jpg&quot;,&quot;large_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/ce00e94a-1873-403b-8f1e-f1a04eae3310.jpg&quot;,&quot;pretty_name&quot;:&quot;bc965abf756e826aafaa90ad90bd505f&quot;}},{&quot;id&quot;:162316,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Introduction to Phytomorphology&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;introduction-to-phytomorphology&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;\ud83d\udcda Plot Summary&lt;\/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The story begins on the day &lt;strong&gt;Ian&lt;\/strong&gt; (or &lt;strong&gt;Do Ian&lt;\/strong&gt;) awakens as a Guide, which is also the day the 100% matched S-Class Esper, &lt;strong&gt;Sean Reinhardt&lt;\/strong&gt;, appears before her.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;\u201cRight now, your wavelength is disgusting.\u201d&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cha Do-ha&lt;\/strong&gt;, the man she believed was her soulmate, abandoned Do Ian simply because she awakened as a Guide.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Afterwards, Ian meets &lt;strong&gt;Sean Reinhardt&lt;\/strong&gt;, the S-Class Esper with a 100% matching rate. However, Sean, who has not undergone his Second Awakening, does not like his Guide. To maximise the efficiency of the Guiding process, Do Ian undergoes a &lt;strong&gt;quasi-imprinting&lt;\/strong&gt; alone and slowly descends into madness within that hellish experience.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;\u201cThere\u2019s no reason for you to hate me that much.\u201d&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Despite her heartbroken pleas,&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;\u201cI never said I hate you. I\u2019m just not interested.\u201d&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sean Reinhardt, her husband, remains utterly cold.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Seven years pass in this way.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;\u201cHello. I am Cha Do-ha. Please take care of me.\u201d&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;The former lover she is now forced to face as the newly appointed &lt;strong&gt;Security Team Leader&lt;\/strong&gt; appears somehow changed.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;alt_title&quot;:&quot;\ud615\uc9c8\ud559 \uac1c\ub860&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;web_novel&quot;,&quot;state&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;story_state&quot;:&quot;completed&quot;,&quot;release_year&quot;:&quot;2025&quot;,&quot;origin_id&quot;:2,&quot;user_id&quot;:25785,&quot;global_note&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I hope you enjoy this chapter! If you like the story and the translation, please consider leaving a comment or sharing it with others. Your support and kind words truly mean the world to me!&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;global_note_position&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;default_price&quot;:0,&quot;cover_id&quot;:5163,&quot;banner_id&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:28:15&quot;,&quot;premium_index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-08-19 13:54:24&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-12-06T10:32:57.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:28:15.000000Z&quot;,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;cover&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:5163,&quot;disk&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;directory&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;b5a6546c-0a4f-4c0c-a61e-91a086b6523b&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;media\/b5a6546c-0a4f-4c0c-a61e-91a086b6523b.jfif&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:384,&quot;height&quot;:549,&quot;size&quot;:58476,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;ext&quot;:&quot;jfif&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;phytoro&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;caption&quot;:null,&quot;exif&quot;:{&quot;FileName&quot;:&quot;NMwMPTHZk5FpW8kqheCeeH0DQOqFZ9-metacGh5dG9yby5qZmlm-.jfif&quot;,&quot;FileDateTime&quot;:1765020746,&quot;FileSize&quot;:58476,&quot;FileType&quot;:2,&quot;MimeType&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;SectionsFound&quot;:null,&quot;COMPUTED&quot;:{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;width=\&quot;384\&quot; height=\&quot;549\&quot;&quot;,&quot;Height&quot;:549,&quot;Width&quot;:384,&quot;IsColor&quot;:1}},&quot;curations&quot;:null,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-12-06T10:32:28.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2025-12-06T10:32:28.000000Z&quot;,&quot;tenant_id&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/b5a6546c-0a4f-4c0c-a61e-91a086b6523b.jfif&quot;,&quot;full_path&quot;:&quot;\/www\/wwwroot\/brightnovels.com\/storage\/app\/public\/media\/b5a6546c-0a4f-4c0c-a61e-91a086b6523b.jfif&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/b5a6546c-0a4f-4c0c-a61e-91a086b6523b.jfif&quot;,&quot;medium_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/b5a6546c-0a4f-4c0c-a61e-91a086b6523b.jfif&quot;,&quot;large_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/b5a6546c-0a4f-4c0c-a61e-91a086b6523b.jfif&quot;,&quot;pretty_name&quot;:&quot;phytoro&quot;}},{&quot;id&quot;:164816,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;In This Life, I Want an Oscar, Not a Husband&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;in-this-life-i-want-an-oscar-not-a-husband&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Synopsis&lt;\/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ha Eun-rae is an actress who is gifted at acting, but her public favorability is at rock bottom due to her loud and messy family history. One day, she catches a chance to make a comeback when she receives a script from South Korea&amp;#039;s most successful director.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&amp;quot;Eun-rae, let&amp;#039;s get married. Retire from acting and be with me.&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;What?&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;You said you wanted a real family.&amp;quot;&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;A man who asks for marriage on the condition of retirement couldn&amp;#039;t possibly be normal. But &amp;quot;a real family&amp;quot;\u2014those words made her accept the proposal.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And four years later.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&amp;quot;You better answer me! Did you really sleep with that woman?&amp;quot;&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;She had become the protagonist of a third-rate morning drama, spitting out clich\u00e9 lines.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Her regret was brief before the bright white headlights of a truck blinded her. It was just like the spotlight on a theater stage.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Honk\u2014!&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When she opened her eyes again, she had returned to 12 years in the past.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this life, she will never live like that again. Herself, the things she loves, and the very place where she felt the most free: her life as an actress.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;\u2018I will only focus on that.\u2019&lt;\/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this life, she will never let go of her career as an actress or the precious connections she makes along the way.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;alt_title&quot;:&quot;\uc774\ubc88 \uc0dd\uc5d4 \ub0a8\ud3b8 \ub9d0\uace0 \uc624\uc2a4\uce74\uc0c1\uc774\uc694&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;web_novel&quot;,&quot;state&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;story_state&quot;:&quot;ongoing&quot;,&quot;release_year&quot;:&quot;2026&quot;,&quot;origin_id&quot;:2,&quot;user_id&quot;:25785,&quot;global_note&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;hope you enjoy this chapter! If you like the story and the translation, please consider leaving a comment or sharing it with others. Your support and kind words truly mean the world to me! \u2661\u2661\u2661&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;global_note_position&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;default_price&quot;:0,&quot;cover_id&quot;:7934,&quot;banner_id&quot;:null,&quot;index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:27:18&quot;,&quot;premium_index_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14 16:27:18&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-05-01T06:15:28.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:27:18.000000Z&quot;,&quot;deleted_at&quot;:null,&quot;cover&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:7934,&quot;disk&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;directory&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;bb6b0b0c-516f-49fe-aea5-0c91f232e3d5&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;media\/bb6b0b0c-516f-49fe-aea5-0c91f232e3d5.jpeg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:649,&quot;height&quot;:952,&quot;size&quot;:444260,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;ext&quot;:&quot;jpeg&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;res&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:null,&quot;caption&quot;:null,&quot;exif&quot;:{&quot;FileName&quot;:&quot;O4k6F2r0FRlOXfxaLu6OW3hlUD4iio-metacmVzLmpwZWc=-.jpeg&quot;,&quot;FileDateTime&quot;:1777616013,&quot;FileSize&quot;:444260,&quot;FileType&quot;:2,&quot;MimeType&quot;:&quot;image\/jpeg&quot;,&quot;SectionsFound&quot;:null,&quot;COMPUTED&quot;:{&quot;html&quot;:&quot;width=\&quot;649\&quot; height=\&quot;952\&quot;&quot;,&quot;Height&quot;:952,&quot;Width&quot;:649,&quot;IsColor&quot;:1}},&quot;curations&quot;:null,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2026-05-01T06:13:42.000000Z&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2026-05-01T06:13:42.000000Z&quot;,&quot;tenant_id&quot;:null,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/bb6b0b0c-516f-49fe-aea5-0c91f232e3d5.jpeg&quot;,&quot;full_path&quot;:&quot;\/www\/wwwroot\/brightnovels.com\/storage\/app\/public\/media\/bb6b0b0c-516f-49fe-aea5-0c91f232e3d5.jpeg&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/bb6b0b0c-516f-49fe-aea5-0c91f232e3d5.jpeg&quot;,&quot;medium_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/bb6b0b0c-516f-49fe-aea5-0c91f232e3d5.jpeg&quot;,&quot;large_url&quot;:&quot;\/storage\/media\/bb6b0b0c-516f-49fe-aea5-0c91f232e3d5.jpeg&quot;,&quot;pretty_name&quot;:&quot;res&quot;}}],&quot;isBookmarked&quot;:false,&quot;unlockedChapterIds&quot;:[],&quot;savedChapterIds&quot;:[],&quot;commentableType&quot;:&quot;series&quot;,&quot;commentableId&quot;:90045,&quot;sortOrder&quot;:&quot;desc&quot;,&quot;ads&quot;:{&quot;header&quot;:{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;&lt;!-- Google tag (gtag.js) --&gt;\n&lt;script async src=\&quot;https:\/\/www.googletagmanager.com\/gtag\/js?id=G-939W497BQW\&quot;&gt;&lt;\/script&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\n  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  gtag(&#039;js&#039;, new Date());\n\n  gtag(&#039;config&#039;, &#039;G-939W497BQW&#039;);\n&lt;\/script&gt;\n&quot;}}},&quot;url&quot;:&quot;\/series\/i-married-the-dragon-i-killed&quot;,&quot;version&quot;:&quot;b6f1ec54238d6b881cc6a88660237066&quot;,&quot;clearHistory&quot;:false,&quot;encryptHistory&quot;:false}"></div>
